      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You use the magic that has created you to great effect. Each day, you can cast any one innate spell that you have from the lyncan ancestry at 7th rank instead of its usual rank. In addition, when you take this feat, you choose between <em>Fiery Body</em> or <em>Energy Aegis</em>. You can cast your chosen spell once per day as an innate arcane 7th rank spell.</span></p>"
